usage:
For labels, skills, invite lists. Built on the Chip part, so committed tags look and behave exactly like chips everywhere else. Listen for added or removed tags:

```js
document.addEventListener('kata-tag-input-add', event => {
  console.log(event.detail.tag, event.detail.tags);
});
```
Use kata-tag-input-remove for removals. Typed text is kept when focus leaves; only Enter or comma commits it.
